{"name":"球体 【万物观察法 最暗处探讨】","thumbnail":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","camera":{"pos":[13.249,8.47,-2.805],"target":[0.385,0.012,-0.493],"zoom":0.52},"light":{"type":"spot","azimuth":113,"elevation":45,"distance":21,"temp":38,"size":1.9,"intensity":1.7},"env":{"hasWall":false,"defaultMat":"1","posterizeLevel":0,"wallColor":"#cccccc","groundColor":"#cccccc","skyColor":"#0d0d0f","skyLightScale":0,"atmosphere":{"enabled":false,"density":0.02,"type":"basic","color":"#ffffff","p1":0,"p2":0},"dof":{"enabled":false,"aperture":2.8,"focusDistance":10},"lightIndicatorEnabled":false},"crop":{"display":"block","left":"504.8px","top":"49.2px","width":"691.2px","height":"691.2px"},"items":[{"type":"builtin","shape":"sphere","pos":[0,2,0],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1],"color":"#ededed","annotations":[{"id":"anno_1782806207284_20","annotationKind":"leader","text":"2.物体暗部的根部\n最少接受到环境光处\n（开启渲染模式后观察更明显）","detailText":"接收不到主光，接收到地面的放光也很微弱，且位置闭塞，所以很暗。","color":"#ededed","dx":180.94027035674839,"dy":-55.946955066735484,"dxN":0.104625,"dyN":-0.054011,"dxW":2.915709,"dyW":-0.901541,"localPos":[1.4116,-1.1073,-0.8804],"localNormal":[0.725,-0.535,-0.434],"baseDist":14.239010249876689,"baseScale":1},{"id":"anno_1782806623004_26","annotationKind":"leader","text":"1.明暗交界带中\n最少接受到环境光处","detailText":"照不到主光，也照不到地面反光，受光极少，所以暗。并且由于靠近亮部形成明暗反差，所以会显得更暗。","color":"#ededed","dx":146.65132598131837,"dy":-44.562561375376745,"dxN":0.083796,"dyN":-0.042512,"dxW":2.221432,"dyW":-0.675021,"localPos":[0.6964,1.4693,-1.1621],"localNormal":[0.355,0.724,-0.592],"baseDist":13.804836822704221,"baseScale":1}]}],"groundAnnotations":[{"id":"anno_1782806214434_21","annotationKind":"leader","text":"3.投影根部\n最少接受到环境光处","detailText":"处于投影中的闭塞处，它的受光来源只可能是球体暗部对它极其微弱的反光，所以很暗。","color":"#ededed","dx":117.86003014017297,"dy":17.948235354499058,"dxN":0.068403,"dyN":0.017391,"dxW":2.051738,"dyW":0.312448,"localPos":[0.5755,1.1289,0],"localNormal":[0,0,1],"baseDist":15.290133050381037,"baseScale":1},{"id":"anno_1782806368059_22","annotationKind":"leader","text":"【万物观察法】3个最暗处：\n\n1.明暗交界受光最少处\n2.物体暗部根部\n3.投影根部受光最少处\n以上3处，随具体环境的变化，经常进行最暗的比拼。\n亮暗观察模棱两可时，要通过受光分析来判断亮暗。","detailText":"","color":"#ededed","dx":208.96865172128253,"dy":-200.93308360452792,"dxN":0.119827,"dyN":-0.192365,"dxW":4.681776,"dyW":-4.501745,"localPos":[-3.5794,-5.3642,0],"localNormal":[0,0,1],"baseDist":20.886874657577877,"baseScale":1}],"groundNormArrows":[],"groundPolygon3ds":[],"groundColorSampleAnnotations":[],"meta":{"detail":"<b>3个最暗处的探讨 </b>\n\n受光最少即最暗\n","category":"几何体"}}